TestCases
Testcase_Name,gpio_reg_wr_rd_test
Description,Register read/write validation for gp0_gpio_8..gp0_gpio_30 including RO/WO/RW fields and interrupt behavior
Preconditions,SoC reset asserted then deasserted; AHB/APB accessible; GPIO0 instance active (MIZAR_GPIO_BASE=0xA001A000)
Pass_Criteria,All reads/writes match expected behavior; RO unchanged on write; WO writes cause side-effect and read value unchanged; RWs latch as expected; interrupts set/clear and masked status per enable; io_ctrl gating works; dout drives when output; data_in reflects pin when input; reset values match spec

Detailed_Steps
Step,Action,Expected,Notes
1,Global reset assert/deassert,All fields reset to default per spec (data_in=0,intr_raw_sts=0,intr_en=0,level_sel=0,io_ctrl=1,dout=0),Check multiple GPIO instances gp0_gpio_[8..30]
2,For each N in [8..30] set io_ctrl=1 (input mode) at gp0_gpio_N[io_ctrl],Writes accepted (RW2),Ensure write-mask or group regs not used here
3,Drive external pin N low then read data_in at gp0_gpio_N[data_in],Read=0 (RO),
4,Drive external pin N high then read data_in at gp0_gpio_N[data_in],Read=1 (RO),
5,Attempt write 1 then 0 to data_in bit,No change on subsequent reads (RO),Negative test
6,Enable pedge_intr_en=1 (RW) keep nedge_intr_en=0 level_sel don’t care,Write accepted,Prepare rising edge test
7,Ensure pin low then toggle to high,On edge: intr_raw_sts=1; intr masked status reflects enable; pending visible in group status if applicable,
8,Write intr_clr=1 (WO) then read intr_raw_sts,Write clears raw status; read back remains 0; reading intr_clr shows no persistent 1,WO behavior
9,Enable nedge_intr_en=1 pedge_intr_en=0 then toggle high->low,On falling edge: intr_raw_sts=1; clear via intr_clr=1,Edge behavior
10,Set level_sel=1 with both edge enables=0 hold pin high,Latched intr per level policy if implemented by HW (else no effect without enables) verify per spec description,If level-trigger support present
11,Set io_ctrl=0 (output mode); write dout=1 then read data_in,Pin drives high; data_in may still mirror pin=1,Check board loopback
12,Write dout=0 then read data_in,Pin drives low; data_in mirrors 0,
13,Attempt to read intr_clr (WO),Read has no effect and returns 0 or undefined per HW; ensure no state change,Negative
14,Attempt to write undefined bits [31:22 except used],Writes ignored; no side-effects; readback unchanged,Negative
15,Randomized write-read across RW fields (io_ctrl,dout,pedge_intr_en,nedge_intr_en,level_sel),All reads after write match written value; unrelated fields unaffected,Coverage sweep
16,Repeat steps 2–15 for all N in 8..30,All pass,Loop over all registers

